+/* Blending is lowered into the fragment shader, so two pipelines that share
+ * one shader but select different blend state must not share a compiled
+ * native pipeline.  A dynamic vertex-input pipeline compiles its shaders after
+ * creation, which is the case an OpenGL frontend always takes; its cache key
